        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Whether a natural prodigy with jetpacks or a veteran soldier airdropped into the fray of battle, you've become accustomed to fighting in the air and using jet propulsion to your advantage. Even if you're still saving up for a jetpack of your own, you already have enough experience to soar like a starship helmed by an ace pilot.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Dexterity</strong> or <strong>Intelligence</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Acrobatics skill and the Technology Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.feats.Item.Living Missile] skill feat.</p>"
